cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproduction package, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "P3: Persistence-Aware Admission Control for DoS-Resilient BLE Resolvable Private Address Resolution — Reproduction Package"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The P3 manuscript authors"
    # Full author names, ORCIDs and affiliations will be completed on acceptance.
abstract: >-
  Deterministic event-driven simulator and experiment scripts reproducing the
  numeric results of the P3 manuscript on persistence-aware resolving admission
  control for BLE RPA-flooding denial-of-service resilience. Every result is
  derived from seeded, deterministic simulation; no measured power or production
  firmware result is claimed.
keywords:
  - Bluetooth Low Energy
  - resolvable private address
  - denial-of-service resilience
  - admission control
  - reproducibility
license: MIT
